{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b8224844-1b52-8b58-98bf-ef19deb543f7",
  "created_at": "2026-02-02T11:10:55-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kevin McCarthy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:06:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:06:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, my name's Kevin too, Kevin McCarthy. I'm calling for my mother, she's in her eighties and doesn't do the phone much anymore. It's about trash. Well, bulk trash, really."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:06:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, two Kevins, we'll keep it straight. Go ahead, what's going on with the bulk trash?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:06:53-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the guy who owns the other half of her building, the landlord, had a tenant move out last week. And instead of dealing with it properly he just dragged everything to the curb. A mattress, a busted dresser, couple of chairs, a pile of bags. Which, you know, is the lazy way to do it, but that's landlords for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:07:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I hear that one a lot. Where's this at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:07:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "150 Eustis Avenue. Up on the Hill. My mother's on the first floor, so it's right in front of her window. Nice view, huh."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:07:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "150 Eustis Avenue, got it. And it's been sitting there since, what, last week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:07:38-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since Wednesday, I'd say. I came by Saturday and it was still there. Nobody's touched it, which tells you pickup doesn't take that stuff without some arrangement."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:07:49-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, bulk items usually aren't part of the regular pickup. There's normally a separate pickup you have to set up ahead of time. Let me note this down. Bulk waste at the curb, 150 Eustis, left by the landlord after a move-out. Is the pile in the street at all or just on the sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:08:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly the grass strip by the sidewalk. The mattress is leaning on the tree, which is a nice touch. It's not blocking the road, but you have to step around it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:08:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is your mom the one who put anything out, or is it all from the other unit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:08:30-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "None of it's hers. She's got a bin and a recycling tote and that's it. I want that clear, because I don't want her getting a notice for somebody else's mess. That would be ridiculous."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:08:44-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood, I'll put in the note that it's not her items. Now, I can send this over so someone looks at it, and I can also tell you how the bulk pickup request works, but the property owner would be the one responsible for arranging it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:09:02-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. And while we're at it, how do I request a replacement? Her recycling tote has a cracked lid and the wheel's gone, and honestly they don't make them like they used to."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:09:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Replacement tote, yep. I can take that request right now. Is it the recycling one only?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:09:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the recycling. The trash bin's fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:09:26-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, replacement recycling tote, 150 Eustis. Damaged lid and a broken wheel. I'll put that in. They usually swap them out on a route day, so just leave the old one at the curb when it comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:09:41-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Hold on a second, [pause] sorry, I've got my granddaughter's school thing tomorrow, picture day, and the shirt has to be ironed, so I'm half watching the iron here. Go on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:09:54-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, don't scorch anything. So, for the landlord pile, I'll flag it for follow-up so someone can check it, and if it's confirmed they can reach out to the owner. I can't tell you exactly when a crew gets by, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:10:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Just so long as somebody looks. Do you need the landlord's name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:10:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If you have it, sure, that helps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:10:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I only know him as Mr. Dolan. Never got a first name. He's the type that doesn't give one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:10:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mr. Dolan, okay. And a number to reach you if they have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:10:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0156. That's my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:10:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0156. So I've got two things: the curbside pile flagged for a check, and the recycling tote replacement. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:10:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:10:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it, Kevin. Have a good one, and enjoy picture day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:10:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Bye."
    }
  ],
